  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/VirusTotal/yara-x/tarball/v1.23.0",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/VirusTotal/yara-x/zipball/v1.23.0",
  "body": "* Compile Unicode character classes in regular expressions using UTF-8 byte sequences for smaller and faster PikeVM code (1baf65c).\r\n* Add support for `\\b{start-half}` and `\\b{end-half}` word boundary assertions in regular expressions (e89aaae).\r\n* Improve `Scanner` creation performance by reusing the WASM linker (#841).\r\n* Auto-discover `libmagic` library search path when building with the `magic-module` feature (64dd140).\r\n* BUGFIX: Allow `--ignore-module` to ignore modules implemented by YARA-X (#833).\r\n* BUGFIX: Don't mistake maps containing `encoding` and `value` keys for encoded values in the Python API (#832).\r\n* BUGFIX: Fix memory leaks in the Go API when `Destroy` isn't called on `Scanner` or `Rules` (c465b46).\r\n* BUGFIX: Fix false positive `E048` (`ConditionTooLarge`) errors when multiple rules share a WASM function (71cfcc9).\r\n* BUGFIX: Support regular expressions in `with` statements without panicking (6b7bbb7).\r\n* BUGFIX: Handle literal null bytes in metadata strings without panicking (c557033, d970018).\r\n* BUGFIX: Fix overlapping undefined-variable bitmaps in WASM memory when rules use more than 8 variables (2fcf36e).\r\n* BUGFIX: Roll back `anchored_sub_patterns` when restoring compiler snapshots after a rule fails to compile (e2153a9).\r\n* BUGFIX: Fix multiple loop hoisting and variable stack issues in the compiler (3b09b1e, 1cdf204, a2a4823, 0165856, 14ec84b).\r\n* BUGFIX: Fix panics, integer overflows, and excessive memory usage when compiling large patterns, wide patterns, hex jumps, and multi-pattern regex sets (f2fa044, ac2e94b, 7883874, 294a49a, c46e2a7, 0f71e3b, eed7687).\r\n* BUGFIX: Fix panics, infinite loops, and error span mapping in `relaxed_re_syntax` mode (64c2a16, 431834f, e3a6a23, 95cd52e, fb2332a).\r\n* BUGFIX: Fix stack overflows on deeply nested expressions, span overflows on large inputs, and Unicode whitespace handling in parser and formatter (9e89546, 9137a19, 64d4d90, b107e9d, 985d3cd, 46ea1af, c7d4afb, 24d964f).\r\n* BUGFIX: Fix integer overflows, 32-bit offset truncation, WASM page boundary slices, and large runtime string handling in compiler and scanner (02c6d37, 3af8e05, 852fed0, 77d84c8).\r\n* BUGFIX: Fix arithmetic overflows and panics on unset fields in `math`, `hash`, `console`, and `pe` modules (e7510e2, 220a268, 30074ca, 8001188, 8f4999a).\r\n* BUGFIX: Fix panics and unbounded recursion in `yr check`, `yr deps`, `yr fix warnings`, and the `tags` linter (360f42f, d90d431, b2293bd, f489e2d).\r\n* BUGFIX: Fix multiple issues in the Language Server, including unbounded recursion, lexical scoping in `find_declaration`, UTF-16 column mapping, and stale CST caching (2c0360c, b4b9192, 5a1c488, 8b6d7f1, 1973e8a, b3e1ffe).\r\n\r\nContributors: @arxhr007, @CfirTsabari, @dharineesh27, @kevinmuoz",
